  "description": "“Would you like to be the bride of a goblin?” Xi'an, the capital of the great Shun. There is a rumor, that at a local apothecary, there is a holy maiden can sing inside your dream and grant wishes to come true. To check if the rumor is true, Prince Sa Heon-Young disguises himself and visits this holy maiden. After listening to her song, as if under an illness, he seeks out the girl... \n\n(Source: Copin Comics) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
